# Overrides the repo-level /include/.dockerignore that would otherwise
# exclude everything at the context root (/*).
# The rsync step uses --ignore-existing, so this file takes priority.
#
# Files needed for the kicad-desktop build:
#   - Dockerfile (consumed by buildx bake, not copied into the image)
#   - sunshine.conf (COPY'd by the Dockerfile)
#   - kicad-autostart.desktop (COPY'd by the Dockerfile)
#   - docker-bake.hcl, tests.yaml (build/metadata only, not in the image)

# Ignore nothing — the Dockerfile uses explicit COPY paths, not COPY . /
*
!Dockerfile
!sunshine.conf
!entrypoint-wrapper.sh
!kicad-autostart.desktop
!docker-bake.hcl
!tests.yaml
